# HGSS Visual Overhaul
## Mod Card

**Replaces all Gen 1 graphics with HeartGold/SoulSilver style sprites.**

### Features
- 151 Pokémon battle sprites (front & back) in HGSS style
- Overworld Pokémon follower sprites
- Trainer battle & overworld sprites
- Updated UI elements (text boxes, HP bars, menus)
- Enhanced color palette

### Credits
- Sprites ripped from Pokémon HeartGold/SoulSilver (Nintendo/Game Freak)
- Sprite sheets sourced from The Spriters Resource
- Mod by Luciano

### Version History
- **1.0.0** — Initial release with full Gen 1 Pokémon sprite coverage
